          "Step 5 (M1): Mark one vanishing dot on the lower border of the second panel and draw twelve lines to it from an evenly spaced row along the top edge, holding the same pencil angle and the same speed on every stroke.",
          "Step 6 (A1): Judge the sheet by edge quality alone: every stroke lands in one pass, ends without a hook and shows no retraced section, which is the standard for a confident line."
