            "Box method: enclose the whole solid in an isometric box, then cut away the shape.",
            "Ellipse construction: isometric square, mid-line tangent points, four centres, two arc sizes.",
            "Isometric is not perspective: parallel edges remain parallel and there is no vanishing point."
